# A Sell-Sword that enters otherwise than by being cast (CR 614.1c applies to any entering): it was cast on turn 1 as a 2/2 with no deaths. On turn 3 Bot1 bolts its
# own Ornithopter, then Ephemerate exiles and returns the Sell-Sword: a new object (CR 400.7) that enters with a counter for the Ornithopter, a 3/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Callous Sell-Sword
Lightning Bolt
Ephemerate
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Callous Sell-Sword.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Callous Sell-Sword.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast(Callous Sell-Sword)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Callous Sell-Sword.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Callous Sell-Sword.Power = 3
